  "bg-canonical/c19d58094ef454f9a14aaeed8293979b889e42d16d21e34b74328369a09381e7.webp": ["The sprinkler goes on at five and it is off again by seven.","Everything green in this photograph is on a timer and everything else is not.","The aloes have not needed a drop of that and they never will.","That lawn is the only thing for forty kilometres that gets a say.","Friday, and by eleven this whole ridge will be one colour again."],
  "bg-canonical/c2bc4bc434666ee3fca00c7c2ef2d03960fc330efd74dfdc6388ae464d69ac36.webp": ["That tree has been shaped by one wind for about forty years.","The washing goes out at this hour because wind is cheaper than electricity.","The lagoon has gone flat and silver, which fools nobody who lives here.","Everything on this street leans the same way, including the people.","Thursday evening, and the only thing still moving out here is the line."],
  "bg-canonical/cb0804cb6b7b16d97e4b4e745a9f2c6bebe1afba41a364eae68e70e98d806fcf.webp": ["Bo-Kaap in the last light, and the wind is doing the housekeeping.","That curtain has been outside the window for about an hour now.","The south-easter has found the one open window on the whole street.","Somebody is going to come home to a lounge full of Signal Hill.","The paint is bright, the hill is gold, and the wind is the loudest thing here."],
  "bg-canonical/ce5d0f16ddede9cc1e32f5052df2960ef6ad5740ab39f347efc318835c38a485.webp": ["That car made it under the carport with about four minutes to spare.","The road is still dry, which is the last thing it will be tonight.","A Free State storm gives you exactly as much warning as it feels like.","Everyone on this street is now standing at a window they never use.","The dust and the rain are about to have a very short argument."],
  "bg-canonical/d1a05b5478ab6c1333917f0fbe31b565b1c1d05444e6f5e4ffcf62e32c449c88.webp": ["The banner is holding on better than the palms and it knows it.","Friday night on the promenade and the sea has cleared everyone's diary.","Every palm on this strip is pointing at the same thing tonight.","The city across the water is having a completely different evening.","Nobody is walking that promenade tonight and the lights know it."],
  "bg-canonical/d3c3724ad566c1fe9afb7127b8863f2267558a537f32c8a7bfbd8a057711d938.webp": ["There is enough moon out there to hang washing by, and somebody did.","It will be dry by morning and damp again by six, which is the deal.","The moon's doing the most tonight."],
  "bg-canonical/d5f43207994b887a457959e59d79b4067eb68c9b33187bdae6831051cb2a90ae.webp": ["Nobody drives past a stall like that on a day like this."],
  "bg-canonical/d656b20a224e9108750856919cf8ae8e30fff2b81fa57d7d27be04e098bdb914.webp": ["Wednesday, and the driveway has become a full contact sport.","Somebody will be picking leaves out of that back seat for a week.","That door is going to shut whether he is ready or not.","The wind opened it faster than he did and he is still laughing.","Every leaf in the street is queueing to get into that car."],
  "bg-canonical/dbadc260a0fbdeff4fc15a7cb347bbacb2def1d5c4fd762e8f398863fb1a4e1b.webp": ["The A/C button is right there and it has clearly not been pressed.","Whoever left that there thought they would only be twenty minutes.","That dashboard is hot enough that the wrapper gave up before the chocolate did.","The steering wheel in there is currently not something you can hold.","Thursday, and that car is going to be worse at four than it is now."],
  "bg-canonical/dde50ae61ffb87cf18a6315df08924dbf2d6d17ed8c4046b8d4926b5e10569f7.webp": ["Bottle this one. Open it in winter."],
  "bg-canonical/df3033afec4a18edec34602b29a703a5bd399dc5cc16df2f1d8894accb02ca88.webp": ["That washing will be dry before she has finished carrying the rest of it out.","She is not looking at the washing, she is looking at where it might land.","Saturday, and the only thing on that line doing any work is the pegs.","Nobody is lighting that Weber until this drops, and everyone in the yard knows it.","The Weber has not been lit once this week and today is not the day."],
  "bg-canonical/e6a67f800f6bb84d369359fa5cdfa7f7decdc601794f9af667aa603d73acde20.webp": ["The pool is measurably fuller than it was at supper time.","Nobody is going to have to top that up for a month.","The pool light is the only thing in this garden still doing its job.","Tuesday night, and the pool is having a far better time than anyone.","The paving has stopped absorbing anything and is just passing it along."],
  "bg-canonical/ebf8739c63fe226d2b2e8923be9bbf5fedac384b6f4fd179391ba814c5aeb9d0.webp": ["That wave landed on the promenade about four seconds before she got there.","Sunday morning, and the sea is throwing the first half of it at her.","She will be tasting salt for the rest of the day and she knows it.","The palm is bent double and she is out here smiling about it.","The promenade is empty in both directions and there is a reason for that."],
  "bg-canonical/ec24bcde25d92412deb6a7e7eddb0b0b657373c139a2cd8dc439b254b3dc25d9.webp": ["That fire was lit before anybody needed it, which is what a clear evening does.","Saturday, and the sky went from orange to blue without one cloud interrupting."],
  "bg-canonical/ed4291a686a0287060e198542952114d5f6433a7d7a98ce2fc5d8f6aaa7ee43b.webp": ["Good night, South Africa."],
  "bg-canonical/f09603654890381efdf31cabc36d3184b2c7b37de192cb9e16857f96402c3dd9.webp": ["You have to drive two hours from anywhere to get a sky like that.","Saturday night, and the entertainment is free and about four billion years old."],
  "bg-canonical/f26595a6b5d772cb483fa8b0bd8d6d60d630fc3d13affbff394650f1df3d574e.webp": ["Not one metre of shade on this promenade, which is why they are out at six.","The sea is that flat about nine mornings a year and this is one of them.","That mountain is that sharp because there is nothing at all in the air today.","The sky is completely empty, which means this is as cool as today gets.","Friday, and by noon that paving is going to be too hot to stand on."],
  "bg-canonical/f60a403312467b3d8a4fdcf64f42b836abce99efc72209df53a22fffd96fc37c.webp": ["The paving is soaked in front of them and it has not rained once.","Saturday morning, and the sea has already been over that railing twice.","Neither of them is going to be the one who suggests turning back.","That sea wall is doing its absolute best and it is still losing.","They will be getting salt off those shoes for the rest of the weekend."],
  "bg-canonical/f644b0ec45868cc656daeffc0ad658e9b7b63c5465a7242ecd3d26393e8a998b.webp": ["He will move twice before lunch and both times by about a metre."],
  "bg-canonical/fb15a66aa4b13408a30a34cec9afb32583e6503d63c391b9f1088265296c66e5.webp": ["The ice in that glass has about four minutes left.","Sunday night, and this promenade is busier than it was all afternoon.","The whole town waited for the sun to go down and then came outside.","That water was cold when somebody put it down there.","Nine at night and the paving is still handing back the afternoon."],
  "bg-canonical/fbba3dfe68594e108ddd289f746f86ae1a6e0fe918d5bd0f3cd9e0b3341432f7.webp": ["Sand in places sand should never be.","Table Mountain is right there and neither of them has looked at it once.","Neither of them can stand up straight and neither of them seems to mind.","The footprints behind them are already filling in and they only just walked there.","The beach itself is moving faster than they are, and in the same direction."],
