  "bg/clear/week_4/dawn/2.webp": ["The Weber has been watching him water that lawn for twenty minutes now.","Coffee in one hand, hose in the other, and the whole day still ahead.","This is the only twenty minutes of the day that belong to him.","The jacaranda is dropping purple on a lawn he has just finished watering.","Nobody inside that house is awake yet and that is entirely the plan."],
