  "bg/heat/week_1/dawn/3.webp": ["The sun has just come up, which is the part nobody is going to believe.","That bonnet did not cool down overnight, which is the part that should worry you.","That egg has been on there about four minutes and it is nearly done.","Nobody in this dorp has needed a stove since about the second week of December.","Monday, and breakfast in this dorp has been sorted by a car bonnet."],
  "bg/heat/week_1/dawn/4.webp": ["That water went in cold at five and it has not been cold since.","He got in before the sun cleared the fence and he has not come out.","He got in at six and he is not planning to get out.","That water was cold about forty minutes ago and nobody has topped it up.","The pool is not optional."],
  "bg/heat/week_1/dawn/5.webp": ["There is steam coming off that pool, which is not a good sign at six.","The water did not cool down last night and he has already checked.","Saturday, and he is in before seven because by ten it is unusable.","The paving round that pool is already too hot for bare feet at six.","That pool is warmer than he is and it is going to stay that way."],
  "bg/heat/week_1/dawn/6.webp": ["She has found the one tile in this house that has not warmed up yet.","She is lying on tile rather than anything soft, and that was a decision.","By nine that windowsill is going to be the worst place in the house.","The sun is only just up and she has already picked her spot.","Sunday, and she has about ninety minutes before she has to move again."],
  "bg/heat/week_1/dawn/7.webp": ["He has picked the shade under a thorn tree, which is barely shade at all.","The sun has been up eleven minutes and he has already stopped moving.","That stoep has chairs on it and none of them will be used before six.","Thursday, and by nine there will be nothing out here worth walking to.","There is no shade on this whole werf that lasts past about ten."],
  "bg/heat/week_1/day/4.webp": ["That bonnet is hotter than most pans ever get on most stoves.","He tried the roof first and the roof was somehow hotter.","Nobody has touched that car door and every one of them knows why.","Nobody here is wondering whether it works. They are watching it work.","Monday, and it is not even eleven o'clock yet, which is the frightening part."],
  "bg/heat/week_1/dusk/3.webp": ["Every leaf on that sunflower has given up and the head is still facing it.","Nobody out here waters anything until that sun is properly behind the hill.","It was watered this morning and you would not know it from here.","That pot has been in full sun since about eleven this morning.","Monday, and it will do all of that again tomorrow without being asked."],
  "bg/heat/week_1/dusk/4.webp": ["That water has been topped up twice and it is still the wrong temperature.","That water has been sitting in the sun all day and it is not cold.","He got in at eleven this morning and this is the second filling.","The sun went down an hour ago and the paving is still giving it back.","Tuesday, and the coolest thing in this entire garden is that dog."],
  "bg/heat/week_1/dusk/6.webp": ["The windpomp has stopped turning, which is how you know the day is over.","That glass has been full for an hour and she is in no hurry.","Sunday, and the Karoo is doing the one thing it does better than anywhere.","The stoep step is still warm and will be for another hour yet.","Nobody has switched a light on inside yet and nobody intends to."],
  "bg/heat/week_1/night/1.webp": ["The ice in that glass has about four minutes left.","Sunday night, and this promenade is busier than it was all afternoon.","The whole town waited for the sun to go down and then came outside.","That water was cold when somebody put it down there.","Nine at night and the paving is still handing back the afternoon."],
  "bg/heat/week_1/night/2.webp": ["Too warm to sleep inside, so the whole family moved under the Milky Way.","Somebody left the light on inside and nobody is going back for it.","The youngest is still awake and has decided the sky is worth it.","Five mattresses on a stoep, and not one of them is a compromise.","Friday night, and the ceiling has been upgraded considerably."],
  "bg/heat/week_1/night/3.webp": ["Thursday night, and the balcony has been promoted to the main room.","It is cooler out here at midnight than it was inside at six.","The ice in that jug never stood a chance and everybody knew it.","That curtain is the only moving air in the entire flat.","Nobody is going back in there until the walls let go of the day."],
  "bg/heat/week_1/night/4.webp": ["Two in the morning, and that fan has been the loudest thing in the house.","The glass of water was a very good idea about four hours ago.","The net is handling mosquitoes. The fan is handling everything else.","Monday starts in five hours and that fan is not going off.","Somebody has already turned the pillow over twice tonight."],
  "bg/heat/week_2/dawn/3.webp": ["The sprinkler goes on at five and it is off again by seven.","Everything green in this photograph is on a timer and everything else is not.","The aloes have not needed a drop of that and they never will.","That lawn is the only thing for forty kilometres that gets a say.","Friday, and by eleven this whole ridge will be one colour again."],
  "bg/heat/week_2/dawn/7.webp": ["They are out at half past five because there is no other window today.","That sun has been up eleven minutes and it is already doing that.","Nobody is carrying water, which is a decision they are going to revisit.","The shade on this road runs out in about two hundred metres.","Wednesday, and this is the coolest it is going to be all day."],
  "bg/heat/week_2/day/2.webp": ["Two fans moving hot air around a room that has been shut since eight.","The file she is fanning with is the one she is meant to be reading.","Two fans, four papers flying, and not one document has been read today.","Nobody in that building can open a window and every one of them has tried.","Tuesday, and somebody in this building is going to be sent home early."],
  "bg/heat/week_2/day/5.webp": ["That number has not moved in eighty kilometres and neither has the scenery.","The aircon is losing and everyone in this car has stopped talking about it.","Saturday, and the only shade for the next hour is inside this car.","Somebody said the padkos would be fine in the boot. Somebody was wrong.","The road ahead has been the same road for a very long time."],
  "bg/heat/week_2/day/7.webp": ["The A/C button is right there and it has clearly not been pressed.","Whoever left that there thought they would only be twenty minutes.","That dashboard is hot enough that the wrapper gave up before the chocolate did.","The steering wheel in there is currently not something you can hold.","Thursday, and that car is going to be worse at four than it is now."],
  "bg/heat/week_2/dusk/1.webp": ["The ice cream is losing and all three of them know it.","Friday, and this promenade is doing the work of six different bars.","Everybody came out at exactly the same time and nobody planned it.","The light will be gone in nine minutes and nobody is hurrying.","That dog has walked this stretch more times than any of them."],
  "bg/heat/week_2/dusk/3.webp": ["Nobody drives past a stall like that on a day like this."],
  "bg/heat/week_2/dusk/6.webp": ["Her eyes are closed and that fan is aimed at exactly one person.","That jug has been refilled twice and it is not even properly dark yet.","The sun has gone and the tiles are still giving it back.","Nobody else in this house is getting near that fan tonight.","Wednesday, and this is the first comfortable minute she has had since eleven."],
  "bg/heat/week_2/dusk/7.webp": ["That grass has been too hot to stand on since about eleven this morning.","Thursday, and this is the first time all day either of them has been cool."],
  "bg/heat/week_2/night/2.webp": ["Nobody has been inside that house since about four this afternoon.","The pool has been the only sensible room in the place all day.","Those beers on the edge are on their third owner tonight.","Saturday, and the water is still warmer than the air above it.","The lights went on two hours ago and nobody has suggested moving."],
