  "bg/heat/week_4/dusk/6.webp": ["Her eyes are closed and that fan is aimed at exactly one person.","That jug has been refilled twice and it is not even properly dark yet.","The sun has gone and the tiles are still giving it back.","Nobody else in this house is getting near that fan tonight.","Wednesday, and this is the first comfortable minute she has had since eleven."],
  "bg/heat/week_4/dusk/7.webp": ["That grass has been too hot to stand on since about eleven this morning.","Thursday, and this is the first time all day either of them has been cool."],
  "bg/heat/week_4/night/2.webp": ["Nobody has been inside that house since about four this afternoon.","The pool has been the only sensible room in the place all day.","Those beers on the edge are on their third owner tonight.","Saturday, and the water is still warmer than the air above it.","The lights went on two hours ago and nobody has suggested moving."],
  "bg/heat/week_4/night/6.webp": ["The dog has worked out where the coldest tiles in the house are.","That is the bathroom floor and it is now his bedroom.","Nobody in this house is getting into that bath tonight.","He has been lying there since about eight and has no further plans.","Wednesday, and the dog has made the only sensible decision so far."],
  "bg/heat/week_4/night/7.webp": ["She is not looking for anything and both of us know it.","That door has been open about ninety seconds and it is staying open.","It has not dropped below twenty-five in that house since about Tuesday.","That is the third time tonight and not one of them is about food.","The fridge is the coolest room in the house."],
  "bg/rain/week_1/night/2.webp": ["The frangipani is dropping flowers all over the paving and taking no responsibility.","Monday night, one lit window, and the rain doing all the talking.","That wall has a damp line on it older than tonight's storm.","The burglar bars are the only straight lines left in the whole street.","Somebody inside has already decided they are not going anywhere tonight."],
  "bg/rain/week_1/night/4.webp": ["The gutter is carrying this street's problems straight down to the next one.","Jacaranda blossom and stormwater, which is Joburg's least favourite combination.","The electric fence is fine. The pavement has completely given up.","Wednesday, and the drive home is going to be a story by tomorrow.","Every drain on this road is now working on somebody else's behalf."],
  "bg/rain/week_1/night/5.webp": ["The pool is measurably fuller than it was at supper time.","Nobody is going to have to top that up for a month.","The pool light is the only thing in this garden still doing its job.","Tuesday night, and the pool is having a far better time than anyone.","The paving has stopped absorbing anything and is just passing it along."],
  "bg/rain/week_1/night/6.webp": ["That umbrella has been closed since the moment it arrived.","Every one of those parking bays was somebody's plan for tonight.","Saturday night at the sea, and the sea has taken the whole promenade.","The painted lines are the only thing out there still holding a shape.","Somebody drove all the way down here to look at this and left."],
