  "bg/rain/week_3/night/6.webp": ["That umbrella has been closed since the moment it arrived.","Every one of those parking bays was somebody's plan for tonight.","Saturday night at the sea, and the sea has taken the whole promenade.","The painted lines are the only thing out there still holding a shape.","Somebody drove all the way down here to look at this and left."],
  "bg/storm/week_1/night/4.webp": ["The tree has seen worse Tuesdays and it will see worse again.","Every gate in this street is shut and every dog has an opinion.","Somewhere behind those walls a whole street is pretending to sleep.","The streetlight is doing overtime that nobody is going to pay for.","Tomorrow morning this road will be covered in somebody else's tree."],
  "bg/storm/week_1/night/5.webp": ["The gutter is telling you exactly how long you left it.","The hose reel is going to feel very unnecessary for a while.","Jacaranda season and a Monday, and the paving is taking both badly.","Whoever parked in the street tonight is regretting it right now.","That security light is doing the best work it has done all year."],
  "bg/storm/week_2/night/3.webp": ["Friday night, and the stoep has quietly become the whole evening.","That one bulb is holding this entire building together.","The polish on that floor was not designed with this much water in mind.","Everything green out there is having the best night of its life.","You can hear the roof better than you can hear the television."],
  "bg/storm/week_2/night/4.webp": ["That car made it under the carport with about four minutes to spare.","The road is still dry, which is the last thing it will be tonight.","A Free State storm gives you exactly as much warning as it feels like.","Everyone on this street is now standing at a window they never use.","The dust and the rain are about to have a very short argument."],
